	(text "Microchip HUB troubleshoot articles:\n\nhttps://support.microchip.com/s/article/USB3-Hub-Upstream-Port-Connect-Enumeration-Failure\nhttps://support.microchip.com/s/article/USB-High-Speed-Chirp-Explained\nhttps://support.microchip.com/s/article/USB3-Connection-Process-and-Attach-Detection\n\nIMPORTANT:\n\nIf I2C/SMBus pull-up resistors are detected by the USB5807C at start-up, the hub will wait indefinitely\nto be configured by the attached I2C/SMBus master. For early prototyping, it may be necessary to physically\nremove the pull-up resistors until the I2C/SMBus master is fully operational and able to properly configure\nthe hub at start-up."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 177.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.889 0.889)
				(color 132 0 132 1)
			)
